dling with a relationship category and accept it with r/ when adding contacts.\n\nKeep tag editing available while add leaves tag input disabled.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":114,"deletions":164},"docs":{"insertions":9,"deletions":8},"test-code":{"insertions":68,"deletions":523}}},{"hash":"bf739ed72268b71e547104e616c6619a74f8873c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Relax phone number validation","messageBody":"Phone fields currently reject useful formatting and labels, while their error message does not identify the reason for rejection.\n\nAccept phone-like eight-digit sequences with ordinary separators and labels. Report specific validation errors and update affected test data.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":44,"deletions":9},"test-code":{"insertions":29,"deletions":17}}},{"hash":"8e1b0d4774b71c7b60a7e617e2fff969219dd6e8","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refine name validation rules","messageBody":"Name validation currently permits digits but excludes customary punctuation and relationship markers.\n\nAllow letters, spaces, hyphens, apostrophes, and recognized relationship markers. Enforce the required trimmed length and reject arbitrary slash usage.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":13,"deletions":7},"test-code":{"insertions":13,"deletions":6}}},{"hash":"04b3c9f5df880170a7b3e4a01a65a2d9ce6488cb","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refine email validation rules","messageBody":"Email validation currently reports a generic format error, which makes correction difficult.\n\nValidate practical email formats with common local-part characters and provide specific errors for invalid email parts.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":80,"deletions":27},"test-code":{"insertions":28,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"5631f7321d0de7f2a9e337b3223d2d75116cc267","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Improve add input validation feedback","messageBody":"The add command currently returns generic errors for missing fields, and the guide does not describe the refined input rules.\n\nReport actionable add errors, distinguish overlong names, and document the name and email formats.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":77,"deletions":21},"docs":{"insertions":6,"deletions":1},"test-code":{"insertions":31,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"9601fd54ad2790d4a851ce437a4f0af33fcc4a0b","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Detect duplicate contacts by email or phone","messageBody":"Contacts currently use names as their identity, even though names can be incomplete or shared.\n\nTreat matching email addresses or phone numbers as duplicate contacts and report the matching field when adding.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":21,"deletions":4},"test-code":{"insertions":39,"deletions":14}}},{"hash":"b29624a90eaf356819ba51989fc9a966587676aa","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Clarify name and phone validation errors","messageBody":"Validation errors currently show more detail than users need for invalid names and incomplete phone numbers.\n\nReport concise messages for invalid name characters and incomplete phone numbers while retaining separate blank and length errors.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":8,"deletions":7},"test-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":3}}},{"hash":"c3d779cda9df291fabc4e6f9fad85e5ba2f38558","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Fix Checkstyle issues","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"functional-code":{"insertions":2,"deletions":1},"test-code":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}}]},{"date":"2026-10-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"dd2859cfda667fba4a24ab270613ea902820b459","isMergeCommit":true,"messageTitle":"Merge pull request #49 from KoeyXianHan123/48-add-client-financial-information","messageBody":"Add client financial information value types","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{}}]}],"JokThreee":[{"date